# Joint-eng-protocol SSOT pointer (AGENTS.md §4d / CONTRIBUTING.md footer): the
# citation must name the governing repo, file, digest, and public check mirror
# verbatim — the pointer IS the verification handle a cold reader checks; guarded.
regex:^Cross-estate joint eng protocol v1 is the SSOT
# One-owner check-guide pointer (references/development.md): CONTRIBUTING.md is not
# packaged in the release ZIP, so the shipped reference resolves the canonical gates
# block by public URL — the pointer IS the one-source handle; guarded verbatim.
regex:^\[CONTRIBUTING\.md\]\(https://github\.com/jacobhausler/hermes-workflows/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING\.md\)$
scripts/vendor/archify/renderers/shared/generated-brand-marks.mjs

# ---- est-q2nwx: owner pr-compliance gate text (main tip 6ee8fba, CI run 37949429728) ----
# The owner's own pr-compliance gate (haus-docs rules/pr-diagram-standard.md v0.2 C1/C2)
# SHIPS these two public repo artifacts; the flagged vocabulary is the gate's mandated
# citation/exemption text, not a private string. Line-anchored (not file-guarded) so any
# future stray hit elsewhere in these files still fires. GUARD, per AGENTS.md rule 4.
.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md:6
.github/workflows/pr-compliance.yml:32

# ---- est-13z1: the bead-close read-back gate (PR #360) ----
# `bead_close` is the SHIPPED PUBLIC GRAMMAR key and `bd -C <store> show <id> --json`
# is the runner's own enforcement argv — both are load-bearing public contract, the
# same GUARD class as the effect-receipt `effects` rows they mirror. The estate-vocab
# regex (`\bbd\b|\bbeads?\b`) fires on the contract naming; neutralizing it would ship
# a gate that names nothing. Line-anchored (not file-guarded): a future stray hit
# elsewhere in these files still fires. GUARD, per AGENTS.md rule 4.
# est-867 follow-up (main red at ee5018d): the est-13z1 and est-q2nwx/est-o8c6o
# hits were pinned by file:LINE and every later wf.py edit shifted them — the exact
# rot est-o8c6o already diagnosed. Re-anchored by FEATURE TOKEN per the playbook
# (a stray hit without a feature token still fires; the est-867 fixture proves it):
# bead/bd = the shipped public bead_close grammar naming; haus-docs = the joint-eng
# protocol citation surface (issue #174). GUARD, per AGENTS.md rule 4.
regex:bead
regex:\bbd\b
regex:est-13z1
regex:haus-docs
